Crowley Hart is the majordomo of the [[People/Valerius Vane|Vane]] residence in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Aurideon/index|Aurideon]]. He is an elderly dwarven man in a good suit, with a braided beard, a shaved head and a monocle like the one [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] carries. He greeted Arctos as Master Arctos, took the names of the rest of the Party, and showed them to the reading room to wait for the minister. Despite the name he is not a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]].

When the Party came for the Quinn painting, Crowley studied Arctos's face and said it was one of the minister's favourites, but that if Arctos truly needed it Vane would understand. He let them take it, and said he would keep their meeting on the books if Vane returned in time. As they loaded the car he came out with a paper that had been faxed to the house for Arctos, the address of [[People/Sbrtlby Jotes|Sbrtlby Jotes]].
